Root Cause                                                                                                                                                                                                
                                                                                                                                                                                                            
  You have 6 deleted ROS bag files still held open by running ros2 bag record processes, totaling approximately 647GB:                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                                            
  ┌───────┬──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┬───────┐                                                                                                                              
  │  PID  │                           File                           │ Size  │                                                                                                                              
  ├───────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────┤                                                                                                                              
  │ 12401 │ place_cola_can_into_blue_box_galbot_v1_0330_1054_1_0.db3 │ 190GB │                                                                                                                            
  ├───────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────┤                                                                                                                              
  │ 17866 │ place_cola_can_into_blue_box_galbot_v1_0330_1114_1_0.db3 │ 182GB │                                                                                                                              
  ├───────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────┤                                                                                                                              
  │ 32940 │ place_cola_can_into_blue_box_galbot_v1_0330_1259_1_0.db3 │ 114GB │                                                                                                                              
  ├───────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────┤                                                                                                                              
  │ 40737 │ place_cola_can_into_blue_box_galbot_v1_0330_1421_1_0.db3 │ 79GB  │                                                                                                                            
  ├───────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────┤                                                                                                                              
  │ 57047 │ place_cola_can_into_blue_box_galbot_v1_0330_1604_1_0.db3 │ 24GB  │                                                                                                                            
  ├───────┼──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┼───────┤                                                                                                                              
  │ 63682 │ place_cola_can_into_blue_box_galbot_v1_0330_1631_1_0.db3 │ 14GB  │                                                                                                                            
  └───────┴──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┴───────┘                                                                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  These files were deleted (moved to Trash) but the ROS processes are still writing to them, so the disk space isn't released.                                                                              
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  Solution                                                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  Kill the old ROS bag recording processes to release the space:                                                                                                                                            
                                                                                                                                                                                                          
  kill 12401 17866 32940 40737 57047 63682                                                                                                                                                                  
                                                                                                                                                                                                            
  Or if they don't respond to SIGTERM:                                                                                                                                                                      
  kill -9 12401 17866 32940 40737 57047 63682                                                                                                                                                               
                                                                                                                                                                                                            
  After killing these processes, you'll immediately recover ~647GB of disk space. The currently active recording (PID 70106) is fine - it's writing to a real file, not a deleted one.
                                                                                                                                                                                                            
